      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross reserve release of GBP 16.7 million for prior underwriting years as of 31 December 2014, representing a 6.902% reduction of opening gross claims outstanding. This release was primarily driven by very favourable trends in incurred claims development during 2014 across all years of 2011 and prior, with the utilisation of IBNR reserves being lighter than in recent times. A specific release of GBP 8.1 million was attributed to the Property class of business. Claims from Superstorm Sandy (2012) were stable and as expected, and exposure to 2013 hailstorms, high winds, and floods was not material, contributing to the overall favourable development.",
